// Termination across modules by default, https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/211: without --modular-termination,
// the rules of revision 3 hold and their checks run on every program that uses the design (a global or callback bound,
// a {:termination_closed} promise, or an unmarked extension of a trait of another module).  The hidden
// --legacy-no-modular-termination restores the rules of 4.11.
// RUN: echo "default: rules, any trait extendable, foreign leaves, bounded foreign implementations: verifies" > "%t"
// RUN: %exits-with 0 %baredafny verify --use-basename-for-filename --show-snippets:false --standard-libraries:false --solver-path %review-z3 --cores 1 "%S/Inputs/github-issue-211-rev3-rules.dfy" >> "%t"
